graph GENERAL_PROGRESS 1
entry GENERAL-PROGRESS-001

gate GENERAL-PROGRESS-001
context TASK_PROGRESS
question "Did the worker produce an observable result before the configured fifteen-minute window ended?"
evidence progress,window,observed_at
YES GENERAL-PROGRESS-002
NO GENERAL-SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN GENERAL-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-PROGRESS-002
context TASK_PROGRESS
question "Is the result a changed artifact, verified behavior, or bounded handoff rather than only a failure list?"
evidence result,artifact_or_behavior,handoff
YES GENERAL-COMPLETE
NO GENERAL-SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN GENERAL-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

terminal GENERAL-COMPLETE COMPLETE "The worker produced meaningful progress."
terminal GENERAL-HARD-STOP HARD_STOP "Progress cannot be established safely."
terminal GENERAL-SOFT-REVIEW SOFT_REVIEW "The stalled or weak result needs campaign review."
terminal GENERAL-UNPROVEN UNPROVEN "The progress claim lacks evidence."

